{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "皆さん、こんにちは。株式会社さくら作プラス代表の中山", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859455.2312608}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "です。本日は2026年7月期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859459.3837311}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "第3四半期決算についてご案内申し上げます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859462.4691346}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は二千二十六年七月期、第三四半期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859465.719071}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "決算概要についてお知らせいたします。売上高については", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859469.6716094}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "百三十六億七千九百万となり、前年同期比", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859473.82139}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "五点四パーセントの減収となりました。これは", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859477.8404605}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "既存円の在籍率向上や工程価格の上昇による", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859481.7379396}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "補助金増額、保育所の新規開設や増床が寄与し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859486.0966802}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "主力の保育サービスにおいて増収となりました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859490.8934283}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一方不動産事業は前期に計上した", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859495.2004046}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "大型不動産売却案件の反動により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859498.6698217}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "当期も不動産売却は実施したものの", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859501.68439}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "全体としては厳粛となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859502.337865}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なお、その他サービスは概ね計画どり進捗しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859507.0008492}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は十億六千百万円となり前年同期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859511.9883466}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "比一点五パーセントの減益となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859513.883418}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の撤退や中核事業の合理化", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859518.8382034}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "業務効率化により営業利益率は七点五パーセントから七", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859522.9497108}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "に向上しました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859524.2994785}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。経常利益は11億2800万円となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859529.315732}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年同期比九点五パーセントの増益となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859531.5882738}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "保育所の新規開設や蔵書の実施により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859536.5830028}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "これらに伴う開演前の補助金収入が加算されたことにより増益となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859539.6361823}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ます。親会社株主に帰属する当期純利益", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859543.7513113}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859546.7552195}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前期に計上した不採算事業の撤退に伴う", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859554.7646244}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "特別損失がなくなったため、当期は増益となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859558.0975447}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて進捗率についてお知らせいたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859560.6522923}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "売上高は通期予算", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859562.7498934}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "各サービスとも堅調に成長しており", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859570.7491822}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "当四半期累計機関において順調に推移しております", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859574.0444772}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は通期予算に対し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859575.8203328}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "対応のない成果や", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859580.7933788}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の定義といた毎期継続している費用削減の資格が", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859584.9404147}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "確実に低下を創出し、収益が", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859589.6214745}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "概ね予算どおりに推移する中でこれらの施策が利益の上振れを", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859592.9867597}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "牽引し、当四半期累計期間において", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859597.4432442}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "通期予算を前倒しして達成しました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859600.1447167}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて貸借対照表です。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859603.741361}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "資産の簿は販売に伴う販売用不動産の減少があった", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859608.2876546}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一補助金収入による未収入金の増加", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859613.2521148}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不動産取得保育施設の新設増床に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859615.9224977}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "試算合計は二十八億", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859620.9049792}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "七千百万円増加しました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859622.5426447}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "草の部は主に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859625.1771235}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "蔵書に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859627.156251}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "禁忌不動産", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859629.3458657}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "増加した結果", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859632.3952355}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "負債合計は21億3300万円増", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859636.2452135}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "らの結果、自己資本比率は四十三点", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859641.2349956}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。9から40。7に低下いたしました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859645.5516284}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて2026年7月に軽トピックスをお知らせいたし", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859649.2281802}
