{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "他人口増加で保育所が不足しいる晴海エリアから月島エリア", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859667.0359282}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25.1-20260712-213043-0cd8fe2f", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "へ、親子で乗れる送迎バスの運行も開始しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783859671.2186248}
